  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 403.08 Processing of Applications for Licensure Renewal. Renewal applications shall be reviewed pursuant to Plc 308.09 and Plc 308.11.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 403.09) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
